The files in src/libvirtpy/rpc/protocol/ are generated by tools/gen_protocol.py and
tools/gen_typed_params.py from libvirt's protocol definitions (src/remote/
remote_protocol.x, src/rpc/virnetprotocol.x, src/rpc/virkeepaliveprotocol.x) and
headers, at the libvirt version pinned in tools/fetch_samples.py. Their structures,
names and numbers are libvirt's wire protocol.

The rule that picks which daemon serves a procedure (Procedure.driver) follows
get_conn_method in libvirt's src/rpc/gendispatch.pl.

libvirt's own test files and schemas are downloaded for testing into .cache/ by
tools/fetch_samples.py; they are not part of this repository or of the distribution.
